 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VYq5F6QHkpMQ7kNvwE4iO3W&_nc_oc=AdqokBiRXOmFfM_JNzxkIeMrRkwsYuwQvugrKwBIBvQGg0sU7gO_3iQ0WAKtOWmuj_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSk51qBIcegxVv7PGoOirUbbDZNwKs-FCF1ZSrcDHrgMQ&oe=6B0DB0D4"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CW027azyTCcQ7kNvwHolGdY&_nc_oc=AdrvGedQn6UySECeGWcExcvpm41_0S-bBf8zaF3OF-YRi-tVz3gQJfwQi-QFqJBxkjY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQHkLNZtgHj0hVXh_pvcvcuMraad_XINgrvPCQd88nD8w&oe=6B0DA71D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XMr3s49LRJkQ7kNvwEzvhwB&_nc_oc=Adq6Be5Ib3uTgv7tVQChGxxxxcsbB9pSiugwf1rFSC90YubQHNBZLmvNR1NGLIzqgwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQUW2jc3qdhkL5DutGPKy7UtBxd5B2aG3yGw7lvadpUPA&oe=6B0D9B34"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2